# Development: leave VITE_API_BASE_URL unset. The API URL is derived from
# the page host on port 4000 (http://localhost:5173 -> http://localhost:4000,
# a phone at http://192.168.x.x:5173 -> http://192.168.x.x:4000), so no
# .env file is needed to run locally on Windows, macOS or Linux.
#
# Production builds (npm run build) MUST set it to the deployed backend:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-backend.example.com
